    <background>Row A44 is auth-v4 §10.5 trap 1 (`appsettings.template.json` `ServiceBus-ConnectionString` KV ref applied on secret-free envs → boot-abort, exit-134 class) + §10.6 doc drift + §6.5 EDIT package application (drafted 2026-08-25; owner-approved 2026-08-25 per Q3 disposition in `notes/decisions/adr-028-a4-integration-conflict-resolution.md`). Three interlocking sub-scopes: (a) code guard preventing the migration-undo vector documented at remediation plan §5 item 3 (H4b/H9 re-apply of template `ServiceBus-ConnectionString` KV ref quietly undoes Δ1 while run reports green); (b) rewriting the never-delete BINDING that half-protects a nonexistent secret (E-3 closed 2026-08-24; `BFF-API-ClientSecret` deleted; FR-39 sunset clause fired) — enforcing the rule as written now misdirects H4/Rotate-Secrets/Seed-ProductionKeyVault into re-seeding the secret into fresh secret-free envs (`RequireSecretFreeIdentity=true` fails fast → boot-abort; or worse, silent-FIC-mask if the ordering is loosened); (c) doc-hygiene sweep replacing the 280-line stale PROVISIONING-CHANGE-REQUEST mirror with the 626-line canonical (the SF-21 meta-surface — this worktree's governing docs re-teach the retired secret contract; the "survived 3 prior audits" failure pattern auth-v4 documented). All three sub-scopes are main-session-only per root §3 (Sub-Agent Write Boundary on `.claude/**` + root `CLAUDE.md`). A35 (master merge) is prerequisite — brings ADR-028 A4 + E-3 closure banner into this worktree; the replacement text cites A4 which is absent pre-merge. Q3 sunset date 2026-11-23 (outer bound; auth-v4 obligation 051-E). Q7 owner narrowing: prong 3 (unmigrated envs) applies to `spaarkedev1` only — no live production exists; no Model 2 stamp provisioned before A36-A42 per Q6.</background>
